    <script type="application/ld+json">{"mainEntity":{"headline":"Microplastics in mangrove sediments of Northern Aceh, Indonesia: abundance, vertical distribution, characteristics, and their relationship with sediment grain size","description":"Mangrove ecosystems play a vital role in supporting aquatic organisms by providing food sources, shelter, and spawning grounds. However, microplastic contamination has emerged as a significant environmental threat that may disrupt the ecological functions of these ecosystems. Unfortunately, studies investigating the vertical distribution of plastics and their relationship with sediment grain size in mangrove environments remain limited. Hence, this study aimed to investigate the abundance, vertical distribution, and characteristics of microplastics, as well as their relationship with sediment grain size in the mangrove sediments of Northern Aceh, Indonesia. A total of 40 sediment samples were collected and analyzed from eight mangrove areas across five sediment layers. The results showed that the abundance of microplastics in the sampling areas ranged from 210 to 440 items/kg dry weight. Higher concentrations of microplastics were observed in the upper  layer (0–10 cm) (p < 0.05). Particles smaller than 500 μm, predominantly black and fragment-shaped, were most common. Polyethylene and polypropylene were the dominant polymers identified, followed by nylon and polystyrene. Microplastic abundance showed a significant correlation with sediment grain size, particularly with granules, very fine sand, and clay fractions. In contrast, a significant negative correlation was observed between microplastic abundance and the percentage of clay.","datePublished":"2026-09-08T00:00:00Z","dateModified":"2026-09-08T00:00:00Z","pageStart":"1","pageEnd":"19","sameAs":"https://doi.org/10.1007/s11356-026-38121-z","keywords":["Microplastics","Mangrove","Sediment layer","Abundance","Sediment grain size","Environment","general","Environmental Chemistry","Ecotoxicology","Environmental Health","Atmospheric Protection/Air Quality Control/Air Pollution","Waste Water Technology / Water Pollution Control / Water Management / Aquatic Pollution"],"image":["https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11356-026-38121-z/MediaObjects/11356_2026_38121_Fig1_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11356-026-38121-z/MediaObjects/11356_2026_38121_Fig2_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11356-026-38121-z/MediaObjects/11356_2026_38121_Fig3_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11356-026-38121-z/MediaObjects/11356_2026_38121_Fig4_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11356-026-38121-z/MediaObjects/11356_2026_38121_Fig5_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11356-026-38121-z/MediaObjects/11356_2026_38121_Fig6_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11356-026-38121-z/MediaObjects/11356_2026_38121_Fig7_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11356-026-38121-z/MediaObjects/11356_2026_38121_Fig8_HTML.png","https://media.springernature.com/lw1200/springer-static/image/art%3A10.1007%2Fs11356-026-38121-z/MediaObjects/11356_2026_38121_Fig9_HTML.jpg"],"isPartOf":{"name":"Environmental Science and Pollution Research","issn":["1614-7499"],"@type":["Periodical"]},"publisher":{"name":"Springer Berlin Heidelberg","logo":{"url":"https://www.springernature.com/app-sn/public/images/logo-springernature.png","@type":"ImageObject"},"@type":"Organization"},"author":[{"name":"Ilham Zulfahmi","affiliation":[{"name":"Prince of Songkla University","address":{"name":"Marine and Coastal Resources Institute, Faculty of Environmental Management, Prince of Songkla University, Songkhla, Thailand","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Universitas Syiah Kuala","address":{"name":"Department of Fisheries Resources Utilization, Faculty of Marine and Fisheries, Universitas Syiah Kuala, Banda Aceh, Indonesia","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Siriporn Pradit","affiliation":[{"name":"Prince of Songkla University","address":{"name":"Marine and Coastal Resources Institute, Faculty of Environmental Management, Prince of Songkla University, Songkhla, Thailand","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Sofiyudin Maae","affiliation":[{"name":"Prince of Songkla University","address":{"name":"Faculty of Science and Technology, Prince of Songkla University, Pattani Campus, Pattani, Thailand","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Prince of Songkla University","address":{"name":"Aquatic Science and Innovative Management Division, Faculty of Natural Resources, Prince of Songkla University, Songkhla, Thailand","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Teuku Haris Iqbal","affiliation":[{"name":"Universitas Syiah Kuala","address":{"name":"Department of Fisheries Resources Utilization, Faculty of Marine and Fisheries, Universitas Syiah Kuala, Banda Aceh, Indonesia","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"},{"name":"Prince of Songkla University","address":{"name":"Faculty of Science and Technology, Prince of Songkla University, Pattani Campus, Pattani, Thailand","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Quanquan Cao","affiliation":[{"name":"Sichuan Agricultural University","address":{"name":"College of Animal Science and Technology, Sichuan Agricultural University, Chengdu, China","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Kizar Ahmed Sumon","affiliation":[{"name":"Agricultural University","address":{"name":"Department of Fisheries Management, Bangladesh\n, Agricultural University, Mymensingh, Bangladesh","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Mohammad Mahmudur Rahman","affiliation":[{"name":"The University of Newcastle","address":{"name":"Global Centre for Environmental Remediation (GCER), College of Engineering, Science of Environment, The University of Newcastle, Callaghan, Australia","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"@type":"Person"},{"name":"Sukree Hajisamae","affiliation":[{"name":"Prince of Songkla University","address":{"name":"Faculty of Science and Technology, Prince of Songkla University, Pattani Campus, Pattani, Thailand","@type":"PostalAddress"},"@type":"Organization"}],"email":"sukree.h@psu.ac.th","@type":"Person"}],"isAccessibleForFree":false,"hasPart":{"isAccessibleForFree":false,"cssSelector":".main-content","@type":"WebPageElement"},"@type":"ScholarlyArticle"},"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"WebPage"}</script>

        
        
